  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "在颇具现代风格的厨房里，一名年轻人正在炉子上的锅中搅拌着。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/fd/86/fd862d60884e9c283e7a7bf76a26cfc5.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/fd/86/fd862d60884e9c283e7a7bf76a26cfc5.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
